1513  89       .                   adc   a,c
1514  4F       O                   ld    c,a
1515  E1       .                   pop   hl
1516  2D       -                   dec   l              ; Bit counter - 1
1517  C2FC14   ...                 jp    nz,RND01       ; Byte processed? no-back
